  "headline": "Haklangr the Bearded guide (God of War Ragnarok): beat delayed slams by waiting, then punish landings",
  "description": "Haklangr catches early dodges. Win by waiting out delays, dodging late, and punishing only after committed landings.",
  "keywords": [
    "haklangr the bearded guide",
    "berserker",
    "delayed slams",
    "hammer",
    "strategy"
  ],
  "articleBody": "1) Failure mode\n- early dodges into delayed slam timing\n- getting clipped by wide arcs at close range\n\n2) Prep\n- plan around late dodges and short confirms\n\n3) Fixed plan\n1) wait out the delay, then dodge late\n2) punish once after the landing\n3) return to mid-range and reset\n\n4) Three punish windows\n- post-landing recovery\n- end of charged swings\n- end of gap-closers\n\nRelated: track gravestones and order via the all-Berserkers index.",
